   "pos": "n",
   "def": "head-of-state immunity, diplomatic immunity, sovereign immunity; also immunity from prosecution granted in exchange for evidence. Verb: to waive immunity. The Charter's removal of it for heads of state and ministers is one of the trial's foundations.",
